<translate>
==== damageCategory ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Parameter for weapons. Specifies what type of damage will be displayed on the enemy that we hit with this weapon.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
DamageCategory = Slash,
</syntaxhighlight>
